{
 "captions": [
  {
   "beat": "s01b02",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s01",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "So, I was having a memory,",
   "start": 3.52,
   "end": 5.324,
   "line_end": 9.437,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s01b02",
   "idx": 1,
   "scene": "s01",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "of the first story I wrote about my emotions.",
   "start": 5.364,
   "end": 9.137,
   "line_end": 9.437,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s01b03",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s01",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "And the more I read, the more I was back inside my mind.",
   "start": 9.857,
   "end": 14.915,
   "line_end": 14.876,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s02b02",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s02",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "And my fear kept pulling the fire alarm.",
   "start": 18.196,
   "end": 21.055,
   "line_end": 21.177,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s02b03",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s02",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "So I imagined myself as the CEO of my mind,",
   "start": 21.597,
   "end": 25.601,
   "line_end": 28.331,
   "pos": "mid",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s02b03",
   "idx": 1,
   "scene": "s02",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "looking around to see why.",
   "start": 25.641,
   "end": 28.611,
   "line_end": 28.331,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s02b04",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s02",
   "speaker": "CONSCIOUSNESS",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "Fear? What are you looking at?",
   "start": 28.651,
   "end": 31.581,
   "line_end": 31.519,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s03b02",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s03",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "The Void.",
   "start": 36.889,
   "end": 37.889,
   "line_end": 37.873,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s03b03",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s03",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "Huge. Unmoving. And its face was pure darkness.",
   "start": 39.397,
   "end": 46.033,
   "line_end": 46.157,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s04b01",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s04",
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "It's going to hurt me.",
   "start": 47.127,
   "end": 48.611,
   "line_end": 48.502,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s04b02",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s04",
   "speaker": "CONSCIOUSNESS",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "It hasn't moved.",
   "start": 49.222,
   "end": 50.332,
   "line_end": 50.527,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s04b03",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s04",
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "That's what scares me.",
   "start": 51.147,
   "end": 52.918,
   "line_end": 54.641,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s04b03",
   "idx": 1,
   "scene": "s04",
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "It's not safe here.",
   "start": 52.958,
   "end": 54.714,
   "line_end": 54.641,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s04b04",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s04",
   "speaker": "CONSCIOUSNESS",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "Nothing is going to hurt you.",
   "start": 55.261,
   "end": 57.147,
   "line_end": 57.012,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s04b05",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s04",
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "You don't know that.",
   "start": 57.632,
   "end": 58.713,
   "line_end": 58.746,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s05b01",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s05",
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "Out! Everybody out!",
   "start": 62.116,
   "end": 64.644,
   "line_end": 64.464,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s05b02",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s05",
   "speaker": "JOY",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "We always come back.",
   "start": 64.684,
   "end": 66.064,
   "line_end": 65.784,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s05b03",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s05",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "Panic attacks, forcing every emotion out of my mind.",
   "start": 66.104,
   "end": 70.69,
   "line_end": 70.41,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s05b04",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s05",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "Causing chaos.",
   "start": 70.73,
   "end": 71.968,
   "line_end": 72.184,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s06b01",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s06",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "Then one day, I put my hand on my fear's shoulder.",
   "start": 73.604,
   "end": 77.927,
   "line_end": 77.79,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 2300
  },
  {
   "beat": "s06b03",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s06",
   "speaker": "CONSCIOUSNESS",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "You need to stop pulling the fire alarm.",
   "start": 79.91,
   "end": 82.451,
   "line_end": 82.559,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s06b04",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s06",
   "speaker": "CONSCIOUSNESS",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "It's causing turmoil.",
   "start": 83.179,
   "end": 84.629,
   "line_end": 84.851,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s06b05",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s06",
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "I'm only trying to keep us safe.",
   "start": 85.671,
   "end": 87.641,
   "line_end": 87.628,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s06b07",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s06",
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "I can't. I'm sorry.",
   "start": 90.048,
   "end": 92.524,
   "line_end": 92.662,
   "pos": "upper",
   "pos_overlap": 3490
  },
  {
   "beat": "s06b09",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s06",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "My fear refused.",
   "start": 94.582,
   "end": 95.977,
   "line_end": 96.203,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s07b02",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s07",
   "speaker": "CONSCIOUSNESS",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "Fear,",
   "start": 98.473,
   "end": 99.473,
   "line_end": 99.077,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s07b03",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s07",
   "speaker": "CONSCIOUSNESS",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "we need to put you in a time-out.",
   "start": 99.897,
   "end": 101.879,
   "line_end": 102.052,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s08b01",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s08",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "So I put my fear into a cage.",
   "start": 105.422,
   "end": 107.566,
   "line_end": 107.828,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 16334
  },
  {
   "beat": "s08b02",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s08",
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "Please don't leave me with it.",
   "start": 108.948,
   "end": 110.984,
   "line_end": 110.878,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s09b01",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s09",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "I told myself it was the responsible thing to do.",
   "start": 115.248,
   "end": 119.503,
   "line_end": 119.43,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s09b02",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s09",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "And I felt sadness.",
   "start": 119.95,
   "end": 121.464,
   "line_end": 121.552,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s10b01",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s10",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "And the Void stood there, stone-faced,",
   "start": 124.372,
   "end": 126.972,
   "line_end": 129.914,
   "pos": "upper",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s10b01",
   "idx": 1,
   "scene": "s10",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "its shadow filling half the room.",
   "start": 127.472,
   "end": 129.959,
   "line_end": 129.914,
   "pos": "upper",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s11b01",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s11",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "And then, when I wasn't looking, I had an image in my mind.",
   "start": 133.484,
   "end": 138.342,
   "line_end": 138.293,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s12b01",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s12",
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "Why are you doing this?",
   "start": 147.563,
   "end": 149.006,
   "line_end": 149.017,
   "pos": "upper",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s12b02",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s12",
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "You're going to hurt me.",
   "start": 149.837,
   "end": 151.34,
   "line_end": 151.246,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s12b03",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s12",
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "This is a trick.",
   "start": 151.866,
   "end": 152.914,
   "line_end": 153.094,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s12b04",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s12",
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "This can't be right.",
   "start": 153.614,
   "end": 154.886,
   "line_end": 154.891,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s12b06",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s12",
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "This doesn't make any sense.",
   "start": 158.111,
   "end": 159.829,
   "line_end": 159.918,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s12b07",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s12",
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "You're supposed to hurt me.",
   "start": 160.638,
   "end": 162.278,
   "line_end": 162.176,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s12b08",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s12",
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "Why are you just standing there?",
   "start": 162.796,
   "end": 164.664,
   "line_end": 164.603,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s12b09",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s12",
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "Are you just here to scare me forever?",
   "start": 165.323,
   "end": 167.377,
   "line_end": 167.439,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s12b11",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s12",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "And the Void did not move.",
   "start": 170.359,
   "end": 172.377,
   "line_end": 174.887,
   "pos": "upper",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s12b11",
   "idx": 1,
   "scene": "s12",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "It stood there.",
   "start": 173.427,
   "end": 174.975,
   "line_end": 174.887,
   "pos": "upper",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s13b02",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s13",
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "inner": true,
   "text": "This is it.",
   "start": 181.157,
   "end": 182.348,
   "line_end": 182.294,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 15186
  },
  {
   "beat": "s13b03",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s13",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "My fear thought the Void had had enough",
   "start": 182.814,
   "end": 184.916,
   "line_end": 188.116,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 8313
  },
  {
   "beat": "s13b03",
   "idx": 1,
   "scene": "s13",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "of its complaining, and would destroy it.",
   "start": 184.956,
   "end": 188.245,
   "line_end": 188.116,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s13b04",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s13",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "But then, my fear felt a hand on its shoulder.",
   "start": 189.236,
   "end": 192.667,
   "line_end": 192.78,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s13b06",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s13",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "And it looked up, into the face of the Void.",
   "start": 196.2,
   "end": 199.367,
   "line_end": 199.388,
   "pos": "upper",
   "pos_overlap": 15781
  },
  {
   "beat": "s14b02",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s14",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "And instead of darkness, my fear saw the twinkling of lights.",
   "start": 203.258,
   "end": 207.469,
   "line_end": 207.584,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s14b03",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s14",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "Like galaxies, and nebulae, and stars of the universe.",
   "start": 208.004,
   "end": 211.701,
   "line_end": 211.693,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s14b04",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s14",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "The Void, filled with bits and pieces of meaning.",
   "start": 212.113,
   "end": 215.084,
   "line_end": 215.128,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s14b06",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s14",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "And for once, my fear wasn't afraid.",
   "start": 219.848,
   "end": 222.649,
   "line_end": 226.485,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s14b06",
   "idx": 1,
   "scene": "s14",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "It felt wonder, and amazement.",
   "start": 223.855,
   "end": 226.517,
   "line_end": 226.485,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s14b08",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s14",
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "Why are you showing me this?",
   "start": 229.505,
   "end": 231.276,
   "line_end": 231.264,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s14b10",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s14",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "And the Void stared into the screen of my consciousness.",
   "start": 235.984,
   "end": 239.359,
   "line_end": 239.648,
   "pos": "upper",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s15b01",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s15",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "My other emotions were looking back.",
   "start": 240.518,
   "end": 242.951,
   "line_end": 242.989,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s15b03",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s15",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "They smiled, just for a moment, then went back to helping me.",
   "start": 247.209,
   "end": 251.825,
   "line_end": 251.705,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s16b02",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s16",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "Then my fear felt the gentle push of the Void.",
   "start": 254.575,
   "end": 257.539,
   "line_end": 257.599,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s16b03",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s16",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "The Void stood there,",
   "start": 258.019,
   "end": 259.742,
   "line_end": 263.369,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s16b03",
   "idx": 1,
   "scene": "s16",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "with galaxies twinkling in its dark facade.",
   "start": 259.782,
   "end": 263.008,
   "line_end": 263.369,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s17b03",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s17",
   "speaker": "CONSCIOUSNESS",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "Fear.",
   "start": 272.239,
   "end": 273.239,
   "line_end": 272.851,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s17b04",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s17",
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "Can I help?",
   "start": 273.671,
   "end": 274.69,
   "line_end": 274.676,
   "pos": "top",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s18b02",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s18",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "The old cage had rusted, its gate hanging open.",
   "start": 282.196,
   "end": 286.224,
   "line_end": 286.169,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s18b03",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s18",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
   "text": "But that was just a small detail.",
   "start": 286.589,
   "end": 288.788,
   "line_end": 288.987,
   "pos": "low",
   "pos_overlap": 0
  },
  {
   "beat": "s19b01",
   "idx": 0,
   "scene": "s19",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "inner": false,
